From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:27:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: defconfig: Enable the Allwinner GPADC driver

The Radxa Cubie A7S wires five channels of the A733 GPADC to board
straps and ID dividers. The sun20i-gpadc driver exposes them as IIO
channels; without CONFIG_SUN20I_GPADC the enabled node has no driver.
Build it as a module, as for other ADC drivers in the defconfig.

CONFIG_KEYBOARD_SUN4I_LRADC is already set as a module.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: the module loads and binds to the GPADC.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index d3ffa86bb4ee..b80682c6b027 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -1711,6 +1711,7 @@ CONFIG_ROCKCHIP_SARADC=m
 CONFIG_RZG2L_ADC=m
 CONFIG_RZT2H_ADC=m
 CONFIG_SOPHGO_CV1800B_ADC=m
+CONFIG_SUN20I_GPADC=m
 CONFIG_TI_ADS1015=m
 CONFIG_TI_AM335X_ADC=m
 CONFIG_XILINX_XADC=m
